    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On activation it explodes into pink powder that rains on the foxes. The group breathes the powder and immediately stirs into mating. Fang Yuan uses Estrus Gu every day while rockmen dig the river, creating new foxes and strengthening the fox army several times over. The text classifies it as an expenditure type Gu left among Hu Immortal’s leftover worms in Dang Hun Mountain, alongside assistance Gu such as burial soul toad and spare fox enslavement Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          415
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
